## 1. Overview of AI Assistance

This document outlines the specific areas where Artificial Intelligence was utilized during the development and documentation of the system's architectural design to maintain full academic and developmental transparency.

| AI Tool Used | Primary Application                          |
| :----------- | :------------------------------------------- |
| **Gemini**   | Diagram generation and structural formatting |

## 2. Detailed Breakdown of AI Contributions

The AI assistant (Gemini) was used strictly as a formatting and visualization aid, rather than a core logic generator.

* **C4 Model Visualizations:** Gemini was utilized to generate the underlying Mermaid code required to render the C4 architectural diagrams (Context, Container, and Component levels) in draw.io.
* **Documentation Structure:** The AI assisted in structuring the architectural explanations to ensure the documentation flowed logically and clearly communicated the system's hierarchy.

## 3. Detailed Breakdown of Human Contributions

All core logic, experimental data, and high-level architectural decisions were produced independently by the author.

* **Empirical Experimentation:** Independently conducted the original SLE-2 profiling experiment that forms the foundational data for this architectural design.
* **Data Collection:** Solely responsible for gathering all empirical metrics from the algorithm benchmark runs.
* **Architectural Decision Making:** Selected all system components, defined container boundaries, and established the interaction flow between the system modules (e.g., separating the profiling controller from the search traversals).
* **Final Verification:** Manually reviewed, corrected, and approved the final system architecture and all AI-generated diagrams to ensure absolute accuracy.

## 4. Statement of Authenticity

I certify that the core software engineering concepts, performance analysis, and system architecture presented in this repository are entirely my original work. AI was used solely to enhance the presentation, visualization, and structural formatting of my original ideas.
